{"id":"665868","name":"羊蝎清炖萝卜","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/665868/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊蝎子","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"2段"},{"name":"姜","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊蝎子切段泡水。","img":"images/665868/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"换几遍水。","img":"images/665868/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热水下锅。","img":"images/665868/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好姜片和葱段。","img":"images/665868/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"萝卜去皮，切段。","img":"images/665868/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"白萝卜焯一下水，去去味道。","img":"images/665868/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"哦，还放了半根山药，切好块。","img":"images/665868/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"羊蝎子清水煮一个小时，放入萝卜继续炖半个小时。","img":"images/665868/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅放一点白胡椒粉和盐调味道。","img":"images/665868/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}